import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Rules: MostWanted" description="The rules on MostWanted, the cops vs. prisoners Minecraft server: fair play, guard conduct and what gets you banned.">
  <article class="page wrap">
    <h1>Rules</h1>
    <p class="lead">Fighting, robbing and breaking out are the game. Everything below is what keeps it fair.</p>
    <p class="note">These are the draft rules. The full set is final before the server opens, and staff may act on anything that ruins the game for others.</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Play fair</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>No cheats.</strong> No hacked clients, x-ray, auto-clickers, macros or mods that give you an advantage.</li>
        <li><strong>No exploits.</strong> Found a bug, a way through a wall that shouldn't be there, or a way to duplicate items or cash? Report it to staff. Using it gets you banned.</li>
        <li><strong>One account.</strong> No alt accounts to dodge a ban, farm bounties or help yourself.</li>
        <li><strong>No real-money trading.</strong> Cash, items and accounts can't be sold or bought for real money.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Respect people</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No harassment, hate speech, threats, or sharing anyone's personal information.</li>
        <li>No spam or advertising other servers.</li>
        <li>Don't pretend to be staff.</li>
        <li>Trash talk about the game is fine. Going after someone personally isn't.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Guards</h2>
      <p>Guards have power over other players, so they're held to a higher standard. See <a href="/guards">Guards</a> for the full code.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>No helping criminals: no letting friends escape, tipping them off, or passing them gear.</li>
        <li>No abusing arrests or tasers on players who aren't breaking out, rioting or wanted.</li>
        <li>Off duty, a guard is just another player.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Minehut</h2>
      <p>MostWanted is reached through Minehut, so <a href="https://minehut.com">Minehut's community rules</a> apply too.</p>

      <h2>Punishments</h2>
      <p>Staff choose the punishment that fits: a warning, a mute, a temporary ban or a permanent one. Cheating and exploiting are a ban from the first time. Think a punishment was a mistake? Appeal in the Discord once it opens.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
